  "bodyText": "Loraine Garrett\n\nYouth Coordinator\n\nWhen Did You Become A Member of First Baptist Church?\n\nMarch 2022\n\nWhat Do You Love About FBCM?\n\nI love the feeling of being welcomed. I love how we incorporate both traditional and contemporary songs into worship, bringing together a diverse group of people.\n\nWhat Hobbies Do You Enjoy?\n\nMy favorite hobby is riding my bicycles, my fat bike for winter and my road bike for the warmer months. I also enjoy practicing calligraphy, bowling, reading, doing puzzles, playing card and board games with my family and friends.\n\nSomething We Should Know\n\nI am an Army veteran, having served 2 tours in Iraq.\n\nFavorite Verse, Story, or Passage From Scripture?\n\nPsalms 30:4-5\n\nyouth@fbcmuncie.org\n\n[Button] < Back -> https://www.fbcmuncie.org/ministers",
